---
description: marzban-vless-cluster project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` for layout, commands and conventions.

- POSIX `sh`, `set -eu`, idempotent scripts; firewall rules via `-C || -I`, never flush.
- Never commit `.env`, keys, certificates, databases, real IPs, domains or home-directory paths. Use `<ip_master>`, `<ip_slave>`, `<master_domain>`, `<slave_domain>`.
- Keep Docker images pinned by tag and digest.
- Human docs (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/*.md) are in Russian; update them in Russian and document only commands that exist in the Makefile and scripts.
- Host-specific hooks belong in gitignored `local/` and `local.mk`.
